"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Athens County runs 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. On the middle, 2025 ran 150% of normal in April to May but only 76% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 45% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1987, with grid 22993 at 62% that year.</p>"}
